<%#
  Homepage features section

  Params: none
%>
<div class="container-main my-section2x">
  <%= render 'section_heading', locals: {
    title: 'The best API doc experience',
    pill: 'pill title',
    description: 'This is the subtext that explains the section further'
  } %>

  <div class="flex flex-col sm:items-center gap-section">
    <%# features are handled as one big data array instead of independent items, because the "scrolling text + fixed image"
    layout relies on having images on their own column, making it difficult to handle each item individually. %>
    <% features = [
      {
        title: 'The API doc your users deserve',
        pill: { icon: 'checkbox-circle-fill', text: 'Improve adoption' },
        cta: { href: '/product', text: 'Check out our product page to learn more' },
        image: '/images/features/api-doc-you-deserve.png',
        tags: [
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'tag here' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'second other tag here' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'third other tag here' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'other and final tag here' },
        ],
        content: '<p>More than just documentation, Bump.sh creates a doorway to your APIs. With an auto-updated API reference and an intuitive Explorer, it empowers your users to explore, understand, and integrate with your APIs faster than ever.</p>',
      },
      {
        title: 'Make 100% of your API ecosystem discoverable',
        pill: { icon: 'checkbox-circle-fill', text: 'Increase discoverability' },
        cta: { href: '/product', text: 'Check out our product page to learn more' },
        image: '/images/features/discoverable-api-ecosystem.png',
        tags: [
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'API catalogs landing pages' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'Unified semantic search' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'Automated SEO & sitemaps generation' },
        ],
        content: '<p>Publish your API catalogs, give complete visibility and a central onboarding experience to your entire ecosystem thanks to Bump.sh Hubs.</p>'
      },
      {
        title: 'Strengthen your developer relations',
        pill: { icon: 'checkbox-circle-fill', text: 'Manage API change' },
        cta: { href: '/product', text: 'Check out our product page to learn more' },
        image: '/images/features/developer-relations.png',
        tags: [
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'API diff' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'Breaking changes detection' },
          { icon: 'hard-drive-2-line', text: 'Changelog and notification' },
        ],
        content: '<p>Managing API changes shouldn\'t feel like a full-time job. Bump.sh simplifies this by automatically spotting every update, creating clear diffs,  keeping your changelog up-to-date and notifying your users with zero effort.</p>'
      }
    ] %>

    <% features.each do |feature| %>
      <%= render "page_home/features_item", **feature %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
